{
	"info": {
		"name": "Agentra API",
		"_postman_id": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890",
		"description": "# Agentra API — Postman Collection\n\nInsurance broker management API for Agentra.\n\n- **Base URL:** `{{base_url}}/api/v1`\n- **Auth:** JWT Bearer Token (`Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}`)\n- **Content-Type:** `application/json`\n- **Response envelope:** `{ status_code, status_message, data }`\n\n## Getting Started\n\n1. Set the `base_url` variable in your environment (e.g. `http://localhost/agentra_api`)\n2. Call **Login** — the test script auto-saves `access_token` and `refresh_token` to environment variables.\n3. All subsequent requests use `Bearer {{access_token}}` automatically.\n\n## Recommended Testing Order\n\n1. Register → POST /auth/register\n2. Login → POST /auth/login *(saves tokens)*\n3. Get Plans → GET /plans?app_id=...\n4. Create Insurer → POST /insurers\n5. Create Customer → POST /customers\n6. Create Policy → POST /policies\n7. Add Coverages → POST /policies/{id}/coverages\n8. Follow-up → POST /policies/{id}/follow-ups\n9. Update Statuses → PATCH /policies/{id}/payment-status, /renewal-status\n10. View Commission → GET /policies/{id}/commission\n11. View History → GET /policies/{id}/logs\n12. Commission List → GET /commissions\n13. Commission Stats → GET /commissions/summary\n14. Mark Received → PATCH /commissions/{id}/mark-received\n15. Correct Policy → PATCH /policies/{id}\n16. Delete Policy → DELETE /policies/{id}\n17. Export → GET /policies/export?month=YYYY-MM",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},

	"auth": {
		"type": "bearer",
		"bearer": [
			{ "key": "token", "value": "{{access_token}}", "type": "string" }
		]
	},

	"variable": [
		{ "key": "base_url", "value": "http://localhost/agentra_api" },
		{ "key": "api_prefix", "value": "/api/v1" },
		{ "key": "access_token", "value": "" },
		{ "key": "refresh_token", "value": "" },
		{ "key": "app_id", "value": "7c2e6a2f-b254-4bbb-87f2-c6ece0f88db2" },
		{ "key": "customer_id", "value": "" },
		{ "key": "insurer_id", "value": "" },
		{ "key": "policy_id", "value": "" },
		{ "key": "commission_id", "value": "" },
		{ "key": "coverage_id", "value": "" },
		{ "key": "coassurance_id", "value": "" },
		{ "key": "product_id", "value": "" },
		{ "key": "plan_id", "value": "" }
	],

	"item": [
		{
			"name": "Auth",
			"description": "Authentication endpoints — register, login, SSO, refresh, logout, password reset.",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Register",
					"request": {
						"auth": { "type": "noauth" },
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
						"url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/register", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "register"] },
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"John Doe\",\n  \"email\": \"john@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"secret1234\",\n  \"password_confirmation\": \"secret1234\",\n  \"phone\": \"081234567890\",\n  \"business_name\": \"PT Asuransi Maju\",\n  \"city\": \"Jakarta\",\n  \"plan\": \"{{plan_id}}\"\n}"
						}
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Login",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"type": "text/javascript",
								"exec": [
									"var json = pm.response.json();",
									"if (json.data && json.data.access_token) {",
									"    pm.environment.set('access_token', json.data.access_token);",
									"    pm.environment.set('refresh_token', json.data.refresh_token);",
									"    console.log('Tokens saved to environment variables');",
									"}"
								]
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"auth": { "type": "noauth" },
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
						"url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/login", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "login"] },
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"john@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"secret1234\"\n}"
						}
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "SSO Login",
					"request": {
						"auth": { "type": "noauth" },
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
						"url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/sso", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "sso"] },
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"assertion\": \"<assertion_token_from_movira_core>\"\n}"
						}
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Refresh Token",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"type": "text/javascript",
								"exec": [
									"var json = pm.response.json();",
									"if (json.data && json.data.access_token) {",
									"    pm.environment.set('access_token', json.data.access_token);",
									"    pm.environment.set('refresh_token', json.data.refresh_token);",
									"}"
								]
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"auth": { "type": "noauth" },
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
						"url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/refresh", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "refresh"] },
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"refresh_token\": \"{{refresh_token}}\"\n}"
						}
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Logout",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
						"url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/logout", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "logout"] },
						"body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{}" }
					},
					"response": []
				},
